{"title": "Water Whip: Pull", "pageid": 27269, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Water_Whip:_Pull", "categories": ["Class actions", "Dexterity saving throws", "Actions which use weapon action DC", "Actions", "Ki actions", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage", "Bugs", "Actions that push or pull"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Water_Whip_Pull.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Water_Whip_Pull.webp/300px-Water_Whip_Pull.webp, /w/images/e/e0/Water_Whip_Pull.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Water_Whip_Pull.webp/300px-Water_Whip_Pull.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Water_Whip_Pull.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Water Whip: Pull</b> is a class action that allows a <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Four_Elements\" title=\"Way of the Four Elements\">Way of the Four Elements</a> monk to deal damage and pull a target towards them.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nUse the water whip to pull the target towards you.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/25px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/38px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/25px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Point\" title=\"Ki Point\">Ki Points</a></dd><dt>Damage: 3~30</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/44px-D10_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/58px-D10_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/D10_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">3d10</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (Weapon action DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Weapon_action_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Weapon action DC</a>)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Pull_Icon.png/25px-Pull_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Pull_Icon.png/38px-Pull_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Pull_Icon.png/50px-Pull_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pulls: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Pull_Icon.png/25px-Pull_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Pull_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Pulls: 9 m (30 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>At level 9 with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Elemental_Casting\" title=\"Improved Elemental Casting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Elemental Casting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Elemental_Casting\" title=\"Improved Elemental Casting\">Improved Elemental Casting</a>, the damage increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">4d10</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_WaterWhip_Pull</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_WaterWhip_Pull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_WaterWhip_Pull\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=DisableBlood_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"DisableBlood (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">DisableBlood</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\">Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Whip\" title=\"Water Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/40px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/60px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/80px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/40px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Whip\" title=\"Water Whip\">Water Whip</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Along with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake\" title=\"Fangs of the Fire Snake\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp/25px-Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp/38px-Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp/50px-Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fangs of the Fire Snake\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp/25px-Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fangs_of_the_Fire_Snake\" title=\"Fangs of the Fire Snake\">Fangs of the Fire Snake</a> (which uses an unarmed attack roll), this is the only other Way of Four Elements abilities that scales with Strength or Dexterity rather than Wisdom.</li>\n<li>Since this uses weapon action DC, <a href=\"/wiki/Heightened_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Heightened Manoeuvre\">Heightened Manoeuvre</a> from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlets_of_the_Warmaster\" title=\"Gauntlets of the Warmaster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlets_of_the_Warmaster\" title=\"Gauntlets of the Warmaster\">Gauntlets of the Warmaster</a> will apply. Conversely, bonuses to spell save DC such as <a href=\"/wiki/Lay_Bare_Their_Weakness\" title=\"Lay Bare Their Weakness\">Lay Bare Their Weakness</a> from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo\" title=\"Hat of Uninhibited Kushigo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo\" title=\"Hat of Uninhibited Kushigo\">Hat of Uninhibited Kushigo</a> <em>will not</em> apply.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Pulling a target off of a ledge with this spell cannot cause fall damage since it is missing the <code><a href=\"/wiki/AddFallDamageOnLand_(spell_flag)\" title=\"AddFallDamageOnLand (spell flag)\">AddFallDamageOnLand</a></code> flag.</li>\n<li>The combat log will incorrectly show the DC calculation as the base DC + Wisdom modifier + proficiency bonus, but the resulting DC will still be based on the higher of the character's Dexterity or Strength modifier.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034607\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4059/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64652/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24463/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1322175/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   80.597      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   80.597      1 -total\n 82.51%   66.501     59 Template:Trim\n 22.31%   17.978      9 Template:Icon_text\n 18.55%   14.949      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 16.43%   13.238      6 Template:Icon_link\n 14.77%   11.906      2 Template:RarityItem\n 13.71%   11.050      2 Template:Item_icon\n  9.96%    8.030      1 Template:Resource\n  8.49%    6.846     13 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27269-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034607 and revision id 318055. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}